  "title": "Why Accessibility shouldn't be an afterthought",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "why-accessibility-shouldnt-be-an-afterthought"
  },
  "excerpt": "1 in 4 adults in the United States —has some form of a disability, making it difficult or impossible to use digital products.",
  "categories": [
    {
